# The USSE's integer and 8-bit color instructions (usse_int.sail), which were usse.c's vbw, sop2, sop2m, i16mad,
# i32mad and i32mad2
op VBW U_VBW
op SOP2 U_SOP2
op SOP2M U_SOP2M
op I16MAD U_I16MAD
op I32MAD U_I32MAD
op I32MAD2 U_I32MAD2
